# CodeCov configuration
**/codecov.yml                                  @hashgraph/green-pond-platform-writers @hashgraph/green-pond-platform-maintainers @hashgraph/platform-ci

# Git Ignore definitions
**/.gitignore                                   @hashgraph/green-pond-platform-writers @hashgraph/green-pond-platform-maintainers @hashgraph/platform-ci
